# REAPER working files. Media is never committed: spec/fixtures/repack_basic/ holds 4.6 GB of takes on the host.
*.RPP-bak
*.rpp-bak
*.RPP-UNDO
*.rpp-undo
*.reapeaks
*.wav
*.mp3

# NOTE: *.arrange.log (and the older *.tsb.log) files are deliberately NOT ignored. Per docs/adr/0005, a
# fixture's log is part of its golden record.

# Scratch comparison output from live REAPER runs. before.rpp is the tracked
# baseline to revert to; after.rpp is what a run produced, and it churns on every
# experiment. A *verified* after.rpp that forms a golden pair with before.rpp per
# docs/adr/0005 is a different thing and should be committed deliberately:
#     git add -f spec/fixtures/<scenario>/after.rpp
spec/fixtures/*/after.rpp

# Coverage
luacov.stats.out
luacov.report.out
